<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda oil port still closed - shipping.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda oil port still closed - shipping.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's main oil export port of Skikda remained closed on Monday and is not expected to reopen until Tuesday evening, a shipping source at the port said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;I heard this morning that it (Skikda) is expected to open tomorrow evening,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The port has been closed since the middle of last week due to high winds.</p>
<p>There are now seven tankers waiting to berth. These will load gas, crude and oil products.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 71 542 8978</p>
</text>
